  conversations and information sharing on healthy child development. It's 
 a great way to connect with your baby\, other families and educators.\n\n*
 *Baby and Me – Treasure baskets**\nThis is a 3-week program. You and you
 r baby are invited to join us to explore Treasure Baskets through songs\, 
 rhymes\, and experiences designed to help you connect with your baby. Trea
 sure Baskets offer children the opportunity to engage their senses fully. 
 They can touch\, taste\, hear\, smell\, and see a diverse range of texture
 s\, inviting them to experiment and make choices.\n\nPre-registration requ
 ired\n\nCentre: EarlyON Thornhill Centre\n\nSource: https://www.missioninc
 .com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
